                        "sense_id": "50497621-43b5-3268-8292-d2e1a6a68a42",
                        "entry_id": "a52c0176-5cc9-33b2-bb61-de1bef1f74d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A man who lacks the refinement of a gentleman; a ruffian."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2317e598-ca6a-4bcc-a7d9-4c2d06ba620f",
                                "sense_id": "50497621-43b5-3268-8292-d2e1a6a68a42",
                                "text": "I was just curious because I wasn't sure if someone like you could even get a date, with you being too good for us ungentlemen and all."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c2c5e99-07b5-45c0-b0ec-a95262eac5c0",
                                "sense_id": "50497621-43b5-3268-8292-d2e1a6a68a42",
                                "text": "That man, that ungentleman, was Sebastian's long-time friend. And even though they had not seen each other in many years, there was always the possibility that he would recognize her. Oh, this would not do."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "502163f8-fec8-4b55-92ef-4178ad45bd46",
                                "sense_id": "50497621-43b5-3268-8292-d2e1a6a68a42",
                                "text": "It was the act of a bounder, an ungentleman; in essence, he was accused of cheating."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
